PERMISSION INCIDENT

    Initial behavior:

        \\DC01\IT
        \\DC01\Engineering
        \\DC01\Management

        Accessible       -> YES
        Write access     -> NO

    Investigation:

        NTFS permissions
            |
            +-- ENGINEERING\GG-IT
            |     +-- Full Control
            |
            +-- SYSTEM
            |     +-- Full Control
            |
            +-- Administrators
                  +-- Full Control

        SMB share permissions
            |
            +-- Everyone
                  +-- Read

    Root cause:

        NTFS permissions allowed write access,
        but SMB share permissions restricted the effective
        network access to Read.


PERMISSION RESOLUTION

    SMB share permissions were corrected:

        IT
            Everyone -> Full

        Engineering
            Everyone -> Full

        Management
            Everyone -> Full

